blocker protocol\n142:## Unchanged\n148:## Unknowns\n153:UNKNOWN-4 the fork's runtime behavior on the ruling P4 wheel set — drained by claims 3.1 and 4.1.\n159:## Stages\n161:### S1 — bootstrap\n165:### S2 — overnight\n169:Claims R3, R4, R5, R6; rulings P4 to P12.\n171:### S3 — morning\n175:## Forbidden\n=== wc ===\n190 specs/flashnext/spec.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
