g 'TRITON_PIN=triton==3.8.0+git4cff872c.rocm10.0.0' --build-arg 'ROCM_DEVEL_PIN=rocm-sdk-devel==10.0.0' --build-arg 'DEVICE_PINS=amd-torch-device-gfx1151==2.13.0+rocm10.0.0 amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151==0.28.0+rocm10.0.0 rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151==10.0.0' . (a prefetched wheel set may exist under ~/.cache/flashnext-wheels/rocm10/). Then, on the coordinator only, run a minimal GPU binding check in that image (--device /dev/kfd --device /dev/dri --security-opt seccomp=unconfined --ipc=host): torch.cuda.is_available(), torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).gcnArchName, a small fp16 and a small fp8-block matmul, and importing the engine package. Record the ROCm/HSA and KFD versions the runtime reports plus the running kernel release (a green probe on a 7.2.0 coordinator is strong but not conclusive for the pair; a red probe attributable to KFD must be re-checked on 7.2.2 before ROCm 10 is written off \\u2014 say so in the notes field). Do not load the checkpoint, do not start a server, do not touch the worker. WRITE THE RECEIPT TO results/rocm10-probe.json \\u2014 NOT under results/receipts/: scripts/receipts-verify.py fails the campaign gate on any fail-status receipt in that directory, and this lane exists to record an outcome, green or red, never to fail the campaign. The receipt carries {step:'rocm10-probe', status, ts, data:{build_ok, compile_seconds, torch, triton, rocm_sdk_core, gcn_arch, cuda_available, matmul_fp16_ok, matmul_fp8_block_ok, engine_import_ok, kernel_release, notes}} with status 'pass' whenever an outcome was recorded. Never remove or retag flashnext:dev; never edit container/, results/receipts/, or the worklist. If the night is running late this lane is the first thing the operator drops. Boundaries: touch only results/rocm10-probe.json.\",\n \"deliveredBehaviors\": [\n  \"By morning the ROCm 10 question is answered with a measured receipt on this exact hardware instead of a guess\",\n  \"The proven 7.14 image and the whole receipt contract are untouchable by construction\"\n ],\n \"readFirst\": {\n  \"specSections\": [\n   \"specs/flashnext/evidence/kyuz0-rocm10.md\",\n   \"IMPORTS.md\"\n  ],\n  \"styleReferences\": [\n   \"container/build.sh\"\n  ]\n },\n \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": \"rocm10-probe-recorded\",\n   \"description\": \"An outcome receipt exists outside the graded receipts dir, the 7.14 image survives untouched, and the receipts gate still passes.\",\n   \"argv\": [\n    \"bash\",\n    \"-euc\",\n    \"python3 -c \\\"import json; r=json.load(open('results/rocm10-probe.json')); assert r['step']=='rocm10-probe' and r['status'] and r['ts'] and isinstance(r['data'],dict) and 'build_ok' in r['data']\\\" && podman image exists localhost/flashnext:dev && python3 scripts/receipts-verify.py\"\n   ]\n  }\n ],\n \"dependencies\": [\n  \"cp-bench\"\n ],\n \"conflictDomains\": [\n  \"results/rocm10-probe.json\"\n ]\n}\n---","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
