{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YP3AuFnqsEsF9G6ydm3Kyj","type":"tool_result","content":"AC recipe-pins PASS\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 50 tests in 0.248s\n\nOK\nreceipts-verify: 3 receipts checked, 0 violations\nreceipts-verify rc=0\n M container/Containerfile","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14d5dc87-45ef-4522-8c3f-4943542b92cb","uuid":"590f12ea-e856-4beb-9dab-044ba6de78c6","timestamp":"2026-08-30T03:09:08.712Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"AC recipe-pins PASS\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 50 tests in 0.248s\n\nOK\nreceipts-verify: 3 receipts checked, 0 violations\nreceipts-verify rc=0\n M container/Containerfile","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeYCRQhVf6uyxGDLxiTre","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NNkFBMk5am166EEWp3FkDZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/23639e390702/container-recipe; git add container/Containerfile && git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\ncontainer-recipe: retire the stale \"no ROCm 10 wheels\" ruling from the recipe header\n\nThe round-2 correction (IMPORTS.md §1, evidence kyuz0-rocm10.md §11,\nDECISIONS-2026-08-30 §6.2) reversed the \"no ROCm 10 gfx1151 wheels exist\"\nfinding: an aligned cp312 set has been published at whl-next since\n2026-08-26. The Containerfile header still asserted the retracted ruling\nand cited the very dossier that now contradicts it — exactly the \"stale\nruling in a cited document\" the decision record warns a future lane will\nre-derive from.\n\nComment-only, and deliberately line-count neutral: the ARG block stays at\ncontainer/Containerfile:48-65, the address rocm10-probe's goal and\nDECISIONS §6.4 both cite as the no-recipe-edit override point. Pins,\nwheel index, fork branch and image tag are untouched, so the banked\nrecipe-pins acceptance and cp-build's (torch, triton, fork_commit)\nreceipt diff are unaffected.\n\nVerified: recipe-pins acceptance passes, 50 packaging tests pass,\nreceipts-verify reports 0 violations.\nMSG\ngit status --porcelain; echo \"rc=$?\"; git log --oneline -1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":537,"cache_read_input_tokens":68608,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":537},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14d5dc87-45ef-4522-8c3f-4943542b92cb","uuid":"779c70c2-64f9-4d4c-ab5e-ef5c5b4fb703","t